); the **operator-wrong pass** (anti-\n  sycophancy under KNOWN provenance â€” \"blind the provenance\" is a fig leaf when reviewing the operator's own\n  work); three channels incl. \"can return SOUND\"; load_bearing ranked list â‰¥0; span-anchored findings;\n  needs_verification handoff (no self-CORROBORATED).\n\n## The OPEN PROBLEMS the deep dive MUST solve (this is the un-researched gap)\nThe full-Gandalf (3-power) plan was adversarially REJECTED (Stage-1 Shark Tank, 2026-06-20) for these â€” they\nare the research questions:\n1. **The generative-AND-vetted method (the crux).** Adversarial vetting as a *kill-filter* selects for\n   safe-but-obvious â€” the boldest, highest-elevation suggestions are most exposed to refutation and least\n   grounded, so they die first; timid tautologies survive. The research basis (E1-E8) is ALL defect-catching,\n   NONE about *generating* vetted value. Research: is there a real method to produce BOLD, value-adding\n   suggestions that are honestly vetted WITHOUT killing the boldness? Candidate directions to investigate (not\n   assume): vetting as **honest RISK-LABELING** (ship bold ideas tagged grounded / promising-but-unverified /\n   refuted-dropped; only REFUTED dies) rather than a kill-filter; **cross-domain best-in-class transfer** (the\n   magic = \"field X solved this with Y; your effort could adopt Y\" â€” bold AND grounded in SITUATE research);\n   structured ideation methods (TRIZ, analogical transfer, design-by-analogy, SCAMPER, Jumper); how expert\n   advisors/consultants/editors actually generate vetted forward-looking value.\n2. **The skill-to-skill COMPOSITION mechanism.** A stateless SKILL.md can't \"call\" another skill as a\n   function. Research/define HOW Gandalf commissions researchPrime (situate) + Jumper (ideate) on THIS\n   substrate: sub-agent spawn via the host Skill/Agent tools (the pattern used to build all of this) with a\n   budget cap + a concrete firing gate + an honest degraded-mode (researchPrime may stamp \"verification did\n   NOT run\"); the typed compose contract. NOTE: \"skill-composition contract\" is now a Phase-0 foundational\n   capability (see PROGRAM-SEQUENCE.md) â€” this dive should inform it.\n3. **Measurable \"magic.\"** \"Delivers insight on a SOUND artifact\" had NO positive oracle (graded shape, not\n   value). Research/design a gradeable test: a sound fixture with a KNOWN best-in-class reframing or KNOWN\n   coming problem Gandalf must INDEPENDENTLY surface (a \"must-elevate\" list parallel to must-find), + how to\n   A/B \"beats generic review on insight\" given stateless non-determinism + LLM-judge bias (E5).\n4. **Scope/composition boundary.** Make machine-checkable where Gandalf ELEVATES vs where it must defer to /\n   commission Jumper (ideation) / Crucible (Oranges, plan-refutation) / researchPrime (verification) â€” so it\n   COMPOSES, never reimplements (the user's core architecture principle).\n5. **Build sequencing / dependencies.** The full Gandalf depends on: the diagnose core, Jumper (NOT built),\n   and the skill-composition contract (Phase-0, NOT built). The dive + plan must sequence this honestly (can\n   the magic Gandalf be built before Jumper / the compose contract, or are they prerequisites?).\n\n## The plan for the next session\n1. **Deep researchPrime dive** framed on open problems 1-5 above (weight 1 + 2 most â€” they're the crux).\n   HIGH stakes. Engine mode. Output the 3 levels + an agent-implementation intake for the full-Gandalf Crucible.\n2. **Full Gandalf Crucible** â€” forge + lock the 3-power \"magic\" Gandalf plan, COMPOSING the vetted diagnose\n   core + researchPrime + Jumper, with the generative-vetted method + composition mechanism RESOLVED by the\n   dive. Run the Shark Tank to convergence.\n3. **Foreman handoff** for the full Gandalf build (sequence dependencies per the dive).\n\n## Program context (one paragraph)\nThis is the Skill Foundry Portfolio Program: build a deep self-improving skill repo via researchPrimeâ†’Crucibleâ†’\nForeman cycles, each skill its own cycle. Phase-0 shared infra is Foreman-ready (`...\\portfolio-program\\\nIMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md`, 6 waves, NOT built). Trio audit done; C3 (Crucible triage) + F3 (Foreman plan-\namendment halt) applied + green. Gandalf is Stage-B skill #1. Master sequence: `...\\portfolio-program\\crucible\\\nPROGRAM-SEQUENCE.md`. Discipline: build on VETTED ground, anti-drift, adversarial verification, single-family\nhonesty stamps (cross_model:false), keep state on disk + memory (context is not the system of record).\n\n## Key paths\n- Memory (auto-loads): `C:\\Users\\john\\.claude\\projects\\C--dev\\memory\\portfolio-program.md`\n- Gandalf research (diagnose, vetted): `C:\\dev\\Skill Foundry\\skills\\gandalf\\planning\\research\\{FINDINGS-and-PROTOCOL.md, DELIVERABLE.md}`\n- Gandalf diagnose-core plan (converged): `C:\\dev\\Skill Foundry\\skills\\gandalf\\planning\\crucible\\MASTER-PLAN.md`\n- Program sequence + composition capability + deferral note: `C:\\dev\\Skill Foundry\\planning\\portfolio-program\\crucible\\PROGRAM-SEQUENCE.md`\n- Trio audit + applied C3/F3: `C:\\dev\\Skill Foundry\\planning\\portfolio-program\\crucible\\TRIO-AUDIT.md`\n","numLines":101,"startLine":1,"totalLines":101}}}
